From: Gemini Mainline Experiment <gemini-mainline@example.invalid>
Date: Thu, 27 Aug 2026 18:02:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 2/5] arm64: mediatek: add CPU8 binder ownership states

Add the public preflight, one-shot CPU_ON budget, success
publication, terminal finalization, and clean rejection states.
---
